%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% divergence: cie-rendering-path
% Scenario: an Indexed space over a converting base. The lookup table's
% bytes are unit-range components of the monitor-like base space; they
% are converted once, when the space is set, into L*a*b* bytes over a
% Lab base, and the indices select the converted entries.
[/Indexed
  [/CIEBasedABC <<
    /WhitePoint [0.95 1 1.09]
    /DecodeABC [
      { dup 0.05 le { 12 div } { 0.06 add 1.06 div 2.2 exp } ifelse } bind
      { dup 0.05 le { 12 div } { 0.06 add 1.06 div 2.2 exp } ifelse } bind
      { dup 0.05 le { 12 div } { 0.06 add 1.06 div 2.2 exp } ifelse } bind
    ]
    /MatrixABC [0.41 0.21 0.02  0.36 0.72 0.12  0.18 0.07 0.95]
  >>]
  3 <ff0000 00ff00 0000ff 808080>
] setcolorspace
0 setcolor 100 100 200 100 rectfill
1 setcolor 100 300 200 100 rectfill
2 setcolor 100 500 200 100 rectfill
3 setcolor 350 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
